#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Derivations.rst:265
msgid "We also already know from our :ref:`discussion of plate settlers <heading_Clarifier_Plate_Settlers>` that we can relate capture velocity, :math:`\\bar v_c`, to :math:`S, L, \\alpha`, and :math:`\\bar v_{z_{Plate}}` by,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Derivations.rst:267
msgid "\\bar v_c = \\frac{S  \\bar v_{z_{Plate}}}{L sin\\alpha cos\\alpha + S}"
